# Lunduke Linux Kernel: default ISO kernel for 0.9.4.
# Seeded 7.2.6-lcos25 on 2026-10-16 CT (lunduke-linux-kernel master e7a72c16,
# PR #21, tag 7.2.6-lcos25); see config/packages.chroot/SEED-llk-7.2.6-lcos25.txt.
# Replaced lcos24 (moved to config/packages.chroot/superseded/).
# Package names are unversioned; the ABI stays 7.2.6-lunduke, so only the
# seeded debs pin the lcos25 revision.
# lcos18: DM_CRYPT=m + XTS (#123), UHID=m (#120), RMI4_F11=y (#121).
# lcos19: radeon=m, vga_switcheroo, DC_SI, HSA, FW compress (#115/#118); 948 modules.
# lcos20: EXFAT_FS=m, iocharset utf8 (#131); 949 modules.
# lcos21: VMD=m (Intel VMD / "RAID On" NVMe), HOTPLUG_PCI_PCIE=y; 950 modules.
# lcos22: RTW89_8852CU/8852BU/8851BU/8922AU=m, RTW88_8814AE=m (#138); 955 modules.
# lcos23: CHROMEOS_LAPTOP=m, MOUSE_CYAPA=m (Chromebook touchpads, #141); 957 modules.
# lcos24: Ubuntu 26.10 HW gap (IPU cameras, Logitech HID++, joydev/xpad/Steam, Intel thermal, AMD_HSMP/TAC5XX2, ACPI_ALS); 1015 modules. No Forced Rust.
# lcos25: UDF_FS=m (#149), LEDS_CLASS_FLASH=m + LEDS_BRIGHTNESS_HW_CHANGED=y (TUXEDO keyboard, kernel#14); 1017 modules.
linux-image-7.2.6-lunduke
linux-headers-7.2.6-lunduke
lunduke-linux-kernel
